WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:34.160
You will not get your hands
on Byakko, nor on my life!

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:36.410
This is it!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.620
Tiger Fang!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.520
It's over, Rei.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:46.050
You won the second round!

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.280
Did we...

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.430
win?

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.890
Yeah. We did.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:56.920
What's the matter, Rei?

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:59.190
I'm passing the baton to you.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:00.410
Uh-huh.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:02.530
That means...

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.400
It's all up to me!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:09.420
Apocalypse
in the Snow Field

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.360
This is a disgrace!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.960
Losing to the BBA Team...!

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:23.370
M-My sincerest apologies.

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:28.960
With all the support I've given you,
I would never have expected these results!

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:34.220
If we end up losing tomorrow, then the
Hiwatari Enterprises' plans will be—

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.160
Don't you worry.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.940
I will never allow that to happen.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.690
Leave me be! Call in Yuriy.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.370
I'll give my orders directly.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.960
That won't be possible.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.440
What?!

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.320
Yuriy is currently...

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.500
W-What is this?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.720
The Borg Incubator.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:01.340
As the name may imply, it's
the ultimate conditioning machine,

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.540
designed to create the ultimate Borg.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:09.760
Its training can awaken enhancements that would
otherwise be hidden deep within the psyche.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:14.870
It eliminates all emotions
other than hatred and bloodlust.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:20.140
Once awakened, he will no
longer be any ordinary Blader,

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:23.400
but a weapon! Yes, Yuriy will
become our ultimate weapon.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.290
Ultimate weapon...

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:29.480
Let tomorrow be the day the BBA
experiences fear in its truest form!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:33.310
With that, the world will fall to Borg.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.050
Hurry. We don't have much time.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:44.130
We're almost there.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:51.240
Mama!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:52.710
Max!

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.280
Long time no see, Max.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:58.500
Papa!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.310
I see you've gotten a little more reliable.

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.640
What are you doing here, Papa?

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.090
I'll explain later.

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:09.210
Emily, prepare the briefing.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.750
Aye-aye, sir!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.030
Go! Go! Go!

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:19.080
We at the PPB Research Team have been
using all that we have to analyze Borg's Beys.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:24.000
They have a much sharper build than your average Bey.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:28.920
Be it the materials or their mechanisms,
you may as well consider them foreign to us.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:33.240
They're likely to be inventions

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.660
of Borg's mad scientist, Dr. Volkov.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:39.020
Their weakness! What about Borg's weakness?

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:42.640
The Research Team came to one conclusion.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.390
Borg has no weakness.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:51.490
They've turned different attack patterns
into data, and programmed that into Beys.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.470
Essentially, it has a counter for every possible attack.

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.000
Okay, Emily.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.500
Still, isn't there something we can do?

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.940
No need to make haste.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.140
We may have not been able
to learn about their Beys,

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:09.740
but we <i>did</i> get a lot of data on their potential energy.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:14.710
What's this?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.340
There are plans for upgrading Dragoon on there.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:20.930
Emily-san!

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.620
But for a job like this, my talent only goes so far.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:29.200
No matter how much I modify Dragoon,
it may never stand up to Borg's Beys.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:33.770
It'll be fine! You won't be working
on Dragoon all on your own, you know.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.290
What?!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.710
We borrowed the hotel's basement

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:47.790
and made it into a PPB development center!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:51.850
I took it upon myself to contact hotel management.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.750
T-T-This is wonderful!

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.850
Even if we complete its materials and mechanisms,

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:03.740
we 'll need someone with proficient skill
and years of experience to finish the job.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:07.440
That's why I got your Dad to come here, Max.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:08.910
You got Papa?

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.280
Your Dad's store has Beys from all over the world.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:15.450
Nobody knows more about parts than him.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:20.330
If I'm to say so myself, he's the supervisor
of the Dragoon Upgrade Project.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:21.960
I'm counting on you, honey.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.360
Leave it to me!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.870
I'll put on an amazing performance for ya!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.280
Papa!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.560
I'm going to help out, too!

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.970
I'll be needing your help!

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:31.920
<i>Okay!</i>

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.560
Use the equipment and our staff as you wish.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:40.380
We're going to finish the ultimate
Dragoon by tomorrow, no matter what!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.910
All of us, together!

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:43.180
Yeah!

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:47.150
Huh? Now that I think about it, where's Takao-kun?

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:59.280
kizutsuita kono karada yasumeru toki mo basho mo nai
My injured body doesn't have a time or place to rest

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:05.240
dakedo tatakau motivation ga minagiru kono tamashii
But my soul is filled with the motivation to fight

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:06.730
Your defense is weak!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:06.970
That's how you get knocked back!

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.860
bit chip ni

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.010
bit chip ni
The secret characters

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:09.960
Darn it!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.700
himitsu no character
inside of the Bit Chips

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:16.200
hibike phase shikakero
Kick off the resonating phase

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.620
Takao! Kai! Max! Rei!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.920
Believe in your dream!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.360
michi no chikara o shinjite ikiru
Continue to believe in the unknown power

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.160
That was a good move.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.000
sunda kokoro no fighter
The fighters inside of your heart

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.280
Thanks!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:27.640
sunda kokoro no fighter
The fighters inside of your heart

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:28.460
But we're not done here!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.110
chichi to ani to no mienai kizuna
One day I swear I'll connect

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.520
One more time!

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:31.850
chichi to ani to no mienai kizuna
One day I swear I'll connect

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:32.060
No, not just one more.
I'll play you as much as you want.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.990
itsuka kanarazu kanaete yaruze
the invisible bond with my father and brother

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:35.640
kono kessen wa tomo to no yakusoku
This match is a promise with my friends

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.690
Go, Dragoon!
kono kessen wa tomo to no yakusoku
This match is a promise with my friends

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.480
Go, Dranzer!
kono kessen wa tomo to no yakusoku
This match is a promise with my friends

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.030
Sekai wo aite ni battle suru
We'll battle against the whole world
Go, Dranzer!

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:41.680
Get stronger, Kinomiya! Much stronger!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:42.780
Moero blade power zenkai
Blaze, my blade! Full power

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:45.200
I will! I'm gonna get
way stronger than this!

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.060
Nazo no chikara wo yume no chikara wo
The mysterious power and the power of dreams

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.160
Everything's up to you.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:48.220
The fate of the world!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.660
Power Soul!

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.760
And our hopes!

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.360
Power Soul!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.120
I know.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.080
You gave up victory to protect the team.

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.440
Rei was so determined that
he had to sacrifice his friend.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:04.510
I'm going to hold all of your hopes tight!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:20.110
You're going to need far more training than that.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.040
You three!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:28.620
You know you're up against Borg...

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.780
but you don't know the tricks they pull.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:34.130
We'll train with you!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.620
Well said.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.670
I'm first!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:39.960
Here we go!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.140
S-Stop!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.870
I didn't say stop 'cause I'm scared.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:55.410
Tomorrow I'll be up against the
strongest player on Borg's team, Yuriy.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:58.480
You guys, from all around the world, are gathered here.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:01.130
I won't get anywhere battling you one-on-one.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:04.950
So how about you all attack me at once?!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.460
Very well, however...

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.960
We won't hold back for training's sake!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.940
I'd be disappointed if you did!

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.260
Let's do it!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.670
- For the world!
- For the world!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:21.200
Yeah! Dragoon!

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:27.610
It's up to you, Takao.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:28.600
Stop their plan

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.140
dead in its tracks!

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:32.650
For the future of Beyblade!

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:34.890
Rei...

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.990
and all of you!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.280
I got it.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.760
I just love Beyblade!

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:47.530
So I'll show 'em just how much I do!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.920
Power control system, complete.

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.520
Mind adjustment system, complete.

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:57.320
Incubator, open.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.630
Awaken, Yuriy!

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.800
T-This cold air...!

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.320
Well done, Yuriy!

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:16.050
This very chill is proof of your increase in power!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:21.020
Yuriy, meet our greatest weapon. Take it!

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:23.430
Take Wolborg, the ultimate Bey!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:30.370
And defeat them! Defeat Takao Kinomiya!

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.370
T-This is...!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.910
Made from the PPB's research, my knowledge,

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:40.480
and Max's father's skills,

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.930
it's the ultimate Dragoon!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:43.710
You guys...

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:48.060
Takao, we've all put our hopes into this!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.220
We've done all we can!

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.520
The rest is all up to you.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.810
I'm not good with this kinda stuff...!

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:58.480
I'm gonna give it all I got to—

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:01.330
Now then! The final battle is about to begin!

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:01.850
Let's—

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.310
Let me say it!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.960
Let's go!!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.570
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.500
The time and day has finally come!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.470
It's the long-awaited final match
of the World Championships!

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:27.470
The Third Match begins now!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:33.350
The First Match saw an unexpected
loss from the BBA's strongest Blader, Kai.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:37.900
In the second match, Rei of China
had a little trouble securing the win.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.900
Going into the final round, teams are even, 1-to-1!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.780
Will Russia win?

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.940
Or will it be the BBA?

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:50.920
The true heroes—the king of kings—
will be decided here and now!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.760
Now, let's introduce our players!

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:56.700
Up first! The BBA Team!

00:11:57.310 --> 00:12:01.710
After many hard-fought battles,
getting stronger each and every time...

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:05.410
The Miracle Boy that's lived up to
his name in many legendary battles...

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:08.010
Takao Kinomiya!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.960
Next, we have someone who captivated the world

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:16.390
with his incredible display of
power in the Ceremony Match!

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:20.480
He's already become a legendary Super Blader!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.440
Yuriy Ivanov!

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:28.950
The battle between these two will decide
the fate of the World Championship Finals!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.600
Keep your eyes peeled, everyone!

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:37.080
You can be sure that this third match
will be one for the history books!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.280
History is being made before your eyes!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:45.280
You won't want to miss
both players' every move!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.560
And there's one more thing!

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:51.020
The third match marks a special addition!

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.180
Every moment of this match

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:56.650
will be broadcasted live, across the globe!

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:05.820
Takao...

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:15.870
Boys and girls around the world!

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:18.160
Can you hear us?

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.910
We can! We can hear you!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.450
Thanks!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.520
We appreciate the support!

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:28.470
It's about to start...

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:29.570
Yeah.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.490
The final battle is about to begin.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:41.320
Now, allow me to introduce a Stadium
that's appropriate for our final battle.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.760
They will be fighting in...

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.310
this Stadium!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:58.250
There's nothing that screams <i>Russia</i> like a
large field with limited maneuverability!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:02.190
Being weighed down by the snow
will make battling in here tough!

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:05.080
Don't let the cold fool you.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.290
The clash of their burning souls

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:10.700
will make for an exciting battle!

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:13.110
I will not lose!

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:16.310
I can't lose! Not until I defeat Borg!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.440
Takao-kun, no matter what,

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:22.290
you must put a
stop to Borg's plans.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.820
We're counting on you, Takao.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.290
We believe in you, Kinomiya.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:35.040
Now then, it finally begins!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.360
The first battle! Ready?

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.030
Three!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.250
Two!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:40.200
One!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.490
Go Shoot!

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.740
Go, Dragoon!!

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.240
Right there, Dragoon!

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:55.410
Kinomiya goes for the first strike!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.790
End this!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.000
What?!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.660
Look out!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:14.180
Another accident, like we had yesterday!

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.120
This is a direct attack on Kinomiya!

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.520
Is he okay?

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.370
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.670
They're using the same tricks on Takao!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:27.230
Yuriy attacked Takao by
abusing his instinct to dodge!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:30.400
He's far more cunning than Boris!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:32.630
Takao! You can do it!

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.400
Ouch...

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:38.180
I already know that you're a bunch of cheaters!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:42.310
Those tricks won't work on me!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:46.840
Look at that!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.890
Wolborg dishes out an incredible assault!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.710
D-Dragoon!

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:54.090
It's so nimble in the snow field!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:57.620
It's just like...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.140
Like a Siberian wolf dashing across the wilderness!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:02.480
Takao!

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:03.980
Fight on, Takao!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.540
What's wrong with you, Kinomiya?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.910
Is that all you've got?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.960
Darn it!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.690
Fortress Defense!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:23.070
Flame Saber!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.390
Dragoon!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.480
Out of the frying pan, into the fire...

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.920
Darn him!

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.900
Those were Draciel and Dranzer's moves!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.920
Come forth, my Sacred Beasts!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:53.910
Genbu! Suzaku!

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.670
He had them?!

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:57.430
U-Unbelievable!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.930
You dirty rat!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.760
Well?

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:05.580
Do you plan on fighting your friends' Sacred Beasts?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.420
What?!

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.030
Something wrong, Kinomiya?

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.640
He suddenly stopped moving!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.020
Why you...!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.700
That's a dirty trick!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.350
What are you doing, Kinomiya?

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.830
Don't stop! Fight!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:24.520
Kai!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:25.970
I don't care.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:29.360
This is all you can do!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.200
So don't stop, Kinomiya!

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:33.050
He's right, Takao!

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.690
You're fighting <i>for</i> Genbu and Suzaku!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.280
I hear you, Kai.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.600
Just wait! Genbu! Suzaku!

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:56.530
I'll win this battle,

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.220
and save the both of you!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.020
Go!!

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:12.010
Takao!

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.920
Wolborg is out!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.710
Kinomiya wins!

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:35.220
Amazing! He crushed Russia's strongest Bey head-on!

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:37.920
He's done it!
He got the first win!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.950
Nice fight, Takao!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:43.950
Seiryu defeated Genbu and Suzaku on its own...

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:46.220
That was the power of the BBA.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:49.940
That's why Takao Kinomiya was able to win.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.940
Sucks for you!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:19:00.900
You can't break the bonds of our friendship
by making me fight their Sacred Beasts!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:04.710
Jeez, now that's a tactic only
you lowlifes could come up with!

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.690
You're weaker than I'd anticipated.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:08.860
What?

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.380
So weak that fighting is pointless.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.040
I have already won.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.880
You lose.

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:16.900
What's your problem?

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:20.250
You keep on spouting this nonsense!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.640
What do you mean I lost?!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.480
Hey! Get back here!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.210
Crap!

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:31.080
If that's how you're gonna be, then I will, too!

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.310
I'll show you as many times as you want!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.670
The power of our friendship!

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:40.990
Now that Kinomiya has gotten the first win,

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:45.100
will the BBA turn things around to secure the match?

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:50.100
Or will the Russian Team bare their fangs?

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:53.050
The Second Set is about to begin!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.240
I will win!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:01.430
As long as I have my friends'
hopes giving me power...

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.930
Go Shoot!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.720
Go, Dragoon!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.810
You're a fool that has yet
to experience true isolation.

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:20.950
I'll show you how horrifying all that isolation can be

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:23.720
with neither friends, nor anyone to save you!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.120
Blizzalog!

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.010
That's an...

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:32.330
Artificial Sacred Beast!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:41.160
Wow! What's going on here?

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:44.200
Dragoon has stopped its attack, frozen in place!

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.600
Darn...

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.920
T-This is an incredible blizzard!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:57.070
I can't keep my eyes open!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:01.110
Wolborg summoned a blizzard?

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.240
Impossible!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.000
Is Borg's technology that advanced?!

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:07.020
Kinomiya!

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.720
Takao!

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:16.420
What the heck is this?

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.730
Welcome to hell.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.760
In here, you are alone.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.030
What was that?!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:02.530
According to my analysis,
the end has finally come!

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:05.840
Could that mean that this is the last episode?

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:09.510
This is no time to get sentimental!

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:14.680
Against Yuriy, who has created an alternate
dimension and uses stolen Sacred Beasts,

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:18.140
can Takao stop Borg's plans?

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:21.540
Next time: Beyblade Forever!

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:24.480
Go Shoot to the final battle!
